      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FE: Offline-First Application",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FE: Offline-First Application",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-LbUOxYLZZdxfC7oK7b62",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -194.31402332597872,
      "y": -1874.5271350924393,
      "width": 1078.689713812618,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1015692815,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 2108241825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791521913379,
      "created": 1791521879902,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Principles: \n- The local database is the primary interface for reading and writing application state. \n- The server is responsible for durability across devices, synchronization, authorization, and collaboration.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Principles: \n- The local database is the primary interface for reading and writing application state. \n- The server is responsible for durability across devices, synchronization, authorization, and collaboration.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0UCCCqpxcZOaH4mfO0yxP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 509.2233688964896,
      "y": -1777.9149977411814,
      "width": 189.59986877441406,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1935736097,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 1114237441,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791522191947,
      "created": 1791522137731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Things to consider:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Things to consider:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BaIfrdL4xMsoxljpD4OVJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 510.0869709167699,
      "y": -1748.4545948019288,
      "width": 663.9194946289062,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1788449185,
      "version": 89,
      "versionNonce": 1587040975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791522189662,
      "created": 1791522145222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Does the application support multiple devices per user?\n2. Can multiple users edit the same resource concurrently?\n3. What happens when users edit the same field?\n4. Is offline functionality required for both reading and writing?\n5. How large can the offline dataset become?\n6. Must updates survive browser refreshes and crashes?\n7. Do we need cross-tab synchronization?\n8. Are there strict consistency requirements for certain operations?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Does the application support multiple devices per user?\n2. Can multiple users edit the same resource concurrently?\n3. What happens when users edit the same field?\n4. Is offline functionality required for both reading and writing?\n5. How large can the offline dataset become?\n6. Must updates survive browser refreshes and crashes?\n7. Do we need cross-tab synchronization?\n8. Are there strict consistency requirements for certain operations?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ANYF8TNKlvfSteCAyGXat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -198.81009569960247,
      "y": -1777.403068708542,
      "width": 119.5198974609375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1734630095,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 1938934959,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791522205178,
      "created": 1791522193556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assumptions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assumptions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NiyFQm9UazD1edy9JE5ox",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -201.0136163183589,
      "y": -1742.3337041942727,
      "width": 607.1395263671875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 560815311,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 999177007,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791522202533,
      "created": 1791522199563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Users manage projects, documents, and tasks.\n* Users can create, update, and delete resources while offline.\n* Multiple devices can edit the same resource.\n* Users may remain offline for days.\n* Local mutations must survive browser restarts.\n* Server-side permissions may change while a user is offline.\n* The application must eventually converge with server state.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Users manage projects, documents, and tasks.\n* Users can create, update, and delete resources while offline.\n* Multiple devices can edit the same resource.\n* Users may remain offline for days.\n* Local mutations must survive browser restarts.\n* Server-side permissions may change while a user is offline.\n* The application must eventually converge with server state.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XI4s1bzPhV9w_2c47mHhQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -199.12170467599225,
      "y": -1512.4953747659638,
      "width": 234.3598175048828,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 630881583,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 1795744065,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791524120103,
      "created": 1791523374859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3Lfnu6u0wtVlCMOxNIVxU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -199.99866136668942,
      "y": -1476.6514393675263,
      "width": 818.8924070828327,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 936706063,
      "version": 894,
      "versionNonce": 1864044449,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791524117184,
      "created": 1791523409365,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) offline read - access synchronized data without internet\n2) offline editing - create/update/delete local resources\n3) Persistent storage - change survive refresh/browser restart\n4) optimistic UI - change appear immediately\n5) operation queue - record pending writes and retry safely\n6) background synchronization - sync pending operation when connectivity returns\n7) conflict detection - detect stale and concurrent updates\n8) recovery UX - failed/pending/conflict changes\n9) multi device synchronization, cross tab consistency, delta synchronization\n10) offline search, attachments (queue file uploads), collaboration, background sync",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) offline read - access synchronized data without internet\n2) offline editing - create/update/delete local resources\n3) Persistent storage - change survive refresh/browser restart\n4) optimistic UI - change appear immediately\n5) operation queue - record pending writes and retry safely\n6) background synchronization - sync pending operation when connectivity returns\n7) conflict detection - detect stale and concurrent updates\n8) recovery UX - failed/pending/conflict changes\n9) multi device synchronization, cross tab consistency, delta synchronization\n10) offline search, attachments (queue file uploads), collaboration, background sync",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7EpFoEZsKx9gptbh0h7a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200.67950515973445,
      "y": -1206.4909083943799,
      "width": 277.73980712890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2076483503,
      "version": 182,
      "versionNonce": 1847924161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791524112301,
      "created": 1791524102345,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e_z9lt5zRtQagf6OHdLHG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -205.9886334693157,
      "y": -1174.8136301659565,
      "width": 773.7594604492188,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 782495695,
      "version": 795,
      "versionNonce": 699660545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791554993781,
      "created": 1791524628539,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Read latency (~<50ms), indexDB, in-memory selectors\n2) optimistic update < 100ms response (local state update)\n3) durability (no ack local-save loss) -> persistent mutation\n4) sync latency (<5s after stable connection) - event-driven sync scheduler\n5) offline duration (operation log/catch up - 7-30 days)\n6) storage scale (10-100k record, pagination)\n7) queue scale (batching/compact where safe)\n8) consistency, retry safety,\n9) multiTab (one active sync coordinator with Web Locks or BroadcastChannel)\n10) accessibility (status announce, keyboard recovery), observability\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Read latency (~<50ms), indexDB, in-memory selectors\n2) optimistic update < 100ms response (local state update)\n3) durability (no ack local-save loss) -> persistent mutation\n4) sync latency (<5s after stable connection) - event-driven sync scheduler\n5) offline duration (operation log/catch up - 7-30 days)\n6) storage scale (10-100k record, pagination)\n7) queue scale (batching/compact where safe)\n8) consistency, retry safety,\n9) multiTab (one active sync coordinator with Web Locks or BroadcastChannel)\n10) accessibility (status announce, keyboard recovery), observability\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wzpizv-9TXyT1IqHVsv7K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -208.20105720168303,
      "y": -904.3236839891898,
      "width": 577.2396850585938,
      "height": 25,
