    {
      "id": "quZIRGPGlEy-VqtIyFF2S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -307.2568760874579,
      "y": 2318.3516875628225,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1911429871,
      "version": 868,
      "versionNonce": 1259837743,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791561964628,
      "created": 1791561262402,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- use 1 IndexedDB transaction\n- Intermediate UI feedback (2 options):\n\n1) Persist before display success\nuser input --> indexedDB transaction --> react notification --> UI show locally\nsaved\nPros: stronger local durability semantic, simpler consistency model\nCons: UI feedback depends on local storage latency\n\n2) Immediate in-memory optimistic update\nuserInput -> update react state immediately -> persist transaction -> confirm\nlocal save\nPros: fastest perceived response (UI)\nCons: require rollback if persistence fail, UI must distinguish temp state from\nlocally saved state\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- use 1 IndexedDB transaction\n- Intermediate UI feedback (2 options):\n\n1) Persist before display success\nuser input --> indexedDB transaction --> react notification --> UI show locally saved\nPros: stronger local durability semantic, simpler consistency model\nCons: UI feedback depends on local storage latency\n\n2) Immediate in-memory optimistic update\nuserInput -> update react state immediately -> persist transaction -> confirm local save\nPros: fastest perceived response (UI)\nCons: require rollback if persistence fail, UI must distinguish temp state from locally saved state\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
