      "updated": 1791562579520,
      "created": 1791562255232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instead of purely FIFO\nA scheduler can:\n\n1. Identify operations whose dependencies are acknowledged.\n2. Select a bounded batch.\n3. Execute independent operations concurrently.\n4. Reconcile acknowledgments.\n5. Release newly unblocked operations.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead of purely FIFO\nA scheduler can:\n\n1. Identify operations whose dependencies are acknowledged.\n2. Select a bounded batch.\n3. Execute independent operations concurrently.\n4. Reconcile acknowledgments.\n5. Release newly unblocked operations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
