      "updated": 1791563737458,
      "created": 1791563721135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** HANDLE 3 ways merge (base, local & remote) ***",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** HANDLE 3 ways merge (base, local & remote) ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GTKX1HfUFpG3K3F2yryvS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1361.4408668722085,
      "y": 4331.086366165775,
      "width": 364.47979736328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 358953071,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 527381199,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791563808731,
      "created": 1791563806203,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. If local equals base, take remote.\n2. If remote equals base, take local.\n3. If local equals remote, take either.\n4. Otherwise, record a conflict.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. If local equals base, take remote.\n2. If remote equals base, take local.\n3. If local equals remote, take either.\n4. Otherwise, record a conflict.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "270G9kJkhSUn5rfJjuCcL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1359.6772450985343,
      "y": 4484.52146047545,
      "width": 519.4596557617188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b12",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1620562223,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 2083936847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791563843612,
      "created": 1791563829855,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Versioning (entity, schema and sync protocol) ***",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Versioning (entity, schema and sync protocol) ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "903M01oIV7Q6R7_eEr1Cz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1356.1500015511856,
      "y": 4532.13924836466,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b13",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1401301167,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 1874073505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791563940679,
      "created": 1791563845031,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Entity version: detect stale edits\n- Local revision: track unacknowledged local changes\n- IndexedDB schema version: manage local storage migrations\n\nAn IndexedDB upgrade transaction can create stores and indexes.\n\nHowever, large data migrations may be better performed incrementally after the\nschema upgrade.\n\nImportant concerns:\n\n* Old tabs can block upgrades.\n* Migration failures must not destroy unsynced operations.\n* Operations may need payload transformation.\n* The application may need a temporary compatibility mode.\n* Rollbacks can be difficult after a destructive schema migration.\n\n- Sync protocol version: maintain compatibility between client and server\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Entity version: detect stale edits\n- Local revision: track unacknowledged local changes\n- IndexedDB schema version: manage local storage migrations\n\nAn IndexedDB upgrade transaction can create stores and indexes.\n\nHowever, large data migrations may be better performed incrementally after the schema upgrade.\n\nImportant concerns:\n\n* Old tabs can block upgrades.\n* Migration failures must not destroy unsynced operations.\n* Operations may need payload transformation.\n* The application may need a temporary compatibility mode.\n* Rollbacks can be difficult after a destructive schema migration.\n\n- Sync protocol version: maintain compatibility between client and server\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
