      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Versioned JS/CSS bundle: cache-first with controlled updates\n* Application shell: offline capable navigation strategy\n* User-specific structured data: indexedDB managed synchronization\n* Public static images: cache-first or stale while revalidate\n* authentication-sensitive response: carefully scoped, avoid unsafe shared\ncaching\n* Critical server validation: network required",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Versioned JS/CSS bundle: cache-first with controlled updates\n* Application shell: offline capable navigation strategy\n* User-specific structured data: indexedDB managed synchronization\n* Public static images: cache-first or stale while revalidate\n* authentication-sensitive response: carefully scoped, avoid unsafe shared caching\n* Critical server validation: network required",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2J2pYRfZX0MrRxlOK22vu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395.2650368344389,
      "y": 6127.297666435851,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1583910735,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 147027393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791566159944,
      "created": 1791564885404,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Application safety:\n\n- A Service Worker can introduce a new application version while old tabs still\nhave pending writes.\n- The new version must understand the existing operation log.\n- This motivates versioned operation payloads and backward-compatible\nmigrations.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Application safety:\n\n- A Service Worker can introduce a new application version while old tabs still have pending writes.\n- The new version must understand the existing operation log.\n- This motivates versioned operation payloads and backward-compatible migrations.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DLtsFctJ9llrWe2pVcFDW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -312.07574409364383,
      "y": 6449.856616972569,
      "width": 1163.9531999193127,
      "height": 34.04951952031207,
