    {
      "id": "r-ClmfyqMCPm5RjApqGM6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -282.4721256465799,
      "y": 8950.64892692494,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 905054145,
      "version": 389,
      "versionNonce": 1165878607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791567522989,
      "created": 1791567037972,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "D. local temporary IDs (temporary IDs on offline task, another operation\nreference it)\n\n1. Use client-generated stable UUIDs if the backend supports them.\n2. Otherwise maintain a temporary-to-server-ID mapping.\n\nClient-generated stable IDs usually simplify offline creation.\n\nE. 2 tabs and crashed leader (TabA holds synchronization leadership and crash\n==> tab B need to become a new leader)\n\nF. Permission revoked while offline\n\nqueue mutation --> server auth. check --> 403 forbidden (client cache auth is not\nsufficent)\n\n* Stop unauthorized synchronization.\n* Mark the operation as rejected.\n* Apply the security policy for retaining or purging local data.\n* Show a clear explanation where disclosure is permitted.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "D. local temporary IDs (temporary IDs on offline task, another operation reference it)\n\n1. Use client-generated stable UUIDs if the backend supports them.\n2. Otherwise maintain a temporary-to-server-ID mapping.\n\nClient-generated stable IDs usually simplify offline creation.\n\nE. 2 tabs and crashed leader (TabA holds synchronization leadership and crash ==> tab B need to become a new leader)\n\nF. Permission revoked while offline\n\nqueue mutation --> server auth. check --> 403 forbidden (client cache auth is not sufficent)\n\n* Stop unauthorized synchronization.\n* Mark the operation as rejected.\n* Apply the security policy for retaining or purging local data.\n* Show a clear explanation where disclosure is permitted.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
